---
/* The four capability slots. Order is fixed: index 0 is the selected service after a pick,
   indices 1-3 become that service's subcategories. All sizing is computed in fitSlots().

   Mobile: inside a service section the four stacked slots collapse to a single-line auto-
   scrolling marquee ([data-sub-marquee]) so the chrome eats far less height and the galleries
   get more of the frame. The controller adds data-mq to [data-bar] and fills the marquee; the
   real slots (which carry the scramble, hover, click-nav and the field-luminance pools) are
   hidden then — the field is dissolved in a section, so nothing depends on their positions. On
   the hero and on desktop the slots render as before. */
---
<div data-bar="" style="position:absolute;left:48px;right:48px;top:52vh;z-index:30;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-family:'SN Ja Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:300;font-size:22.5px;letter-spacing:.22em;transition:top 900ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)">
<div data-bar-track="" style="display:contents">
<button type="button" data-slot="" data-i="0" style="font:inherit;letter-spacing:inherit;border:0;background:none;padding:0;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);cursor:pointer;transition:color 300ms ease;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0">REAL-TIME CONTENT</button>
<button type="button" data-slot="" data-i="1" style="font:inherit;letter-spacing:inherit;border:0;background:none;padding:0;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);cursor:pointer;transition:color 300ms ease;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0">SCREENS PRODUCTION</button>
<button type="button" data-slot="" data-i="2" style="font:inherit;letter-spacing:inherit;border:0;background:none;padding:0;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);cursor:pointer;transition:color 300ms ease;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0">MIXED REALITY</button>
<button type="button" data-slot="" data-i="3" style="font:inherit;letter-spacing:inherit;border:0;background:none;padding:0;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);cursor:pointer;transition:color 300ms ease;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0">EQUIPMENT RENTAL</button>
</div>
{/* Mobile-only single-line marquee of the active section's subs. Populated + shown by the
    controller (data-mq on [data-bar]); display:none everywhere by default. */}
<div data-sub-marquee="" aria-hidden="true" style="display:none"><div data-sub-track=""></div></div>
</div>
